# SOP 4.3 Incident Notifications v2.0, Design Working Document

Working document, v0.2, 30 August 2026. Phases 1 to 4 of the SOP 4.3 rewrite plan. This document is the working design for the notification rules under the LIMSOC Incident Categorisation model (Operational Change Proposal Pack v0.9). Phase 5 converts the agreed content into SOP 4.3 v2.0 on the LSV SOP template.

Sources: SOP 4.3 Incident Notifications v1.1 (effective 23 December 2025, endorsed COO); LIMSOC Incident Categorisation Operational Change Proposal Pack v0.9 (30 August 2026); LIMSOC Feature Brief LIMSOC-BRIEF-LSV-2026-012 v0.1 (F. Young, 17 August 2026).

Decisions recorded in this document were taken by Nicholas Wood on 30 August 2026 unless marked as a recommendation awaiting confirmation.

