### 4.3 Attendance

Attendance expectations are separate from notification. The subscription list determines who is informed; this section determines who is expected to attend or to consider attending. Attendance applies to the Area Response Officer, the State Duty Officer, the State Agency Commander and the Senior Manager Operations.

