| Tag: Resuscitation | | ARO | D01 |
| Tag: Member Injury | | ARO | DZZ |
| Tag: Media Interest | | SAC, SMO | ZZZ media |

Decision (N. Wood, 30 Aug 2026): attendance split completely from notification; notifications carry no monitor or attend qualifier.

Outcome Fatality is set as soon as the fatality is confirmed, so it is available during the response and is the correct trigger for the Should attend expectation.

